<Site title="Aviation background" description="The aircraft-maintenance background behind Marv’s systematic, detail-minded approach to building pages." active="about"><section class="wrap page-intro"><a class="back-link" href="/about/"> About me</a><h1>Before websites,<br>there were aircraft.</h1><p>I trained and worked in aircraft maintenance. The habits I developed there still influence how I approach digital work.</p></section><section class="wrap case-story"><h2>Understand the parts.<br>Check how they fit.</h2><div><p>Maintenance work taught me to follow procedures, pay attention to small details and troubleshoot systematically. A problem needs to be understood before it can be fixed.</p><p>Building pages is a different kind of work, but that mindset remains useful: work through the brief, keep the details consistent and review how the finished page functions.</p><a class="text-link" href="/work/">See what I build now </a></div></section><ContactBand/></Site>
